 "words": 233,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "At Gibeon the LORD appeared to Solomon in a dream by night",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 4.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask what I should give you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I am only a young man",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I do not know how to go out or come in",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not gold, not years, not victory, but this is what he prayed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 3.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Give your servant a listening heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To judge your people",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To discern between good and evil",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A listening heart, a listening heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven years of cedar and of stone cut at the quarry",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 5.24,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "No hammer and no iron tool was heard upon the hill",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The cloud filled the house of the LORD",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the priests could not stand to minister",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But will God really dwell on the earth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The heavens, even the highest heaven, cannot contain your love",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Three thousand proverbs flowed from him like rivers to the sea",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 5.27,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His fame went out to every land and kings came there to see",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And knowledge of the Holy One is understanding",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But when Solomon grew old his heart was led astray",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 4.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To other gods and silver, and he wandered from the way",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Futility of futilities",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everything is futile",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The end of the matter, now that all has been heard",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fear God and keep his commandments",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give your servant a listening heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
